(slower-b747-sv01-rectangle-course-3dof)
*title B747 point-mass rectangular waypoint reduction
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*units/fmt alt m f.3
*units/fmt vel m/sec f.3
*units/fmt mass kg f.3
*units/fmt long deg f.3
*units/fmt lat deg f.3
*units/fmt gama deg f.3
*units/fmt psi deg f.3
*runtime status route mode=rectangle start-latitude-deg=0.0 start-longitude-deg=0.0 duration-s=320.0 start-altitude-m=100.0 rectangle-length-m=12000 rectangle-width-m=12000 elevated-corner-altitude-m=200 rectangle-speed-mps=153.0
*trajectory 1 b747 start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=100.0 long=0.0 lat=0.0 vel=153.0 gama=0.0 psi=90.0 time=0.0 mass=288756.9
  *segment 1 rectangle
    *integ dtprnt=1.0 dt=0.02
    *fly alpha=3.1
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) sref=510.96672
    *prop thrust=(thrust) mdot=0
    *when time>320.0 stop
*end
